{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pity This Busy Monster</i> is a physics-based narrative game where you experience employment at Spanky\u2019s Donut Fulfillment Warehouse, the least efficient donut factory in the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill orders by throwing the correct donuts into boxes, keep your work area clean, and unwind after work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything happens for a reason. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in a single sitting, a 60 to 90 minute experience.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Spanky\u2019s\u2122</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We\u2019re thrilled to have you join us as a valued team member. You\u2019ll be heading up our Donut Department as one of our highly valued 8,0129,839 employees.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fulfill the donut orders, 6 per box in the customers\u2019 requested flavors and preferred sprinkle accoutrement.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Throwing donuts is encouraged\u2013 just be careful to avoid dropping the icing side on the floor.\u00a0\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enjoy the luxury your very own employee lodging, complete with Relaxation Station, coffee maker, vending machine, and 50\u201d flat screen.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We aim to please. That\u2019s why we believe you\u2019ll be satisfied with your existence with us here at Spanky\u2019s. \u2665</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Next to Godliness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714740/2a969c0ac0db59c7f8cb04d2a4afe80010545332.jpg"},{"name":"Adequate Employee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714740/1ce62e5b25c2ce5c79117bf41e0a1dc274ec2d88.jpg"},{"name":"Under Severe Fin